---

<Layout title="Portafolio">

<section id="inicio" class="min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center px-4">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm">
      Full Stack Developer
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-4 mb-6 leading-tight">
      Hola, soy <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500">Mario Velasquez</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Especializado en el desarrollo de aplicaciones web y móviles. 
      Experto en <strong>Angular</strong> y <strong>Node.js</strong>, con un fuerte enfoque 
      en la arquitectura de bases de datos y despliegue en la nube.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="#proyectos" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition-all shadow-lg">
        Ver Proyectos
      </a>
      <a 
  href="/CV - Mario Velasquez.pdf" 
  download="CV_MarioVelasquez.pdf"
  class="border border-gray-300 text-gray-700 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
>
  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
    <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/>
  </svg>
  Descargar CV
</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="acerca" class="py-20 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Sobre Mí</h2>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-5 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
          Analista Desarrollador Full Stack
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Cuento con una sólida experiencia en el diseño y construcción de soluciones tecnológicas para los sectores <strong>bancario, logístico y gubernamental</strong>. Mi enfoque profesional combina la capacidad de análisis con la implementación técnica rigurosa, especializándome en sistemas de misión crítica y alta disponibilidad.
        </p>
        
        <ul class="space-y-5 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold mt-1">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Especialista en Ecosistemas Modernos:</strong> 
              Experto en la construcción de sistemas escalables utilizando 
              <strong>.NET (C#)</strong>, implementando arquitecturas robustas bajo patrones 
              <strong>DDD (Domain-Driven Design) y N-Capas</strong>, junto con entornos modernos de 
              JavaScript (Angular, Node.js, Vue.js).
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold mt-1">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Integraciones y CORE:</strong> 
              Amplia experiencia en integraciones complejas y la 
              <strong>migración de sistemas CORE</strong>, asegurando transiciones estables y seguras.
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-500 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold mt-1">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong>Automatización y Eficiencia:</strong> 
              Enfoque en la <strong>automatización de procesos de negocio</strong> para optimizar flujos operativos y garantizar la integridad de los datos.
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border-b-4 border-blue-500 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-blue-400 dark:shadow-xl">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">Banca</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Sistemas CORE y transaccionales</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border-b-4 border-cyan-500 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-cyan-400 dark:shadow-xl">
          <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">Gobierno</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Automatización y seguridad</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border-b-4 border-emerald-500 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:border-emerald-400 dark:shadow-xl col-span-2 flex items-center gap-4">
           <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-white">.NET / DDD</div>
           <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Arquitecturas empresariales robustas</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="habilidades" class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Stack Tecnológico</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
          Backend & Lenguajes
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['C# (.NET)', 'Node.js', 'TypeScript', 'PHP', 'VB', 'C'].map(skill => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
          Frontend & Mobile
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Angular', 'Vue.js', 'Flutter', 'Ionic', 'Tailwind CSS','PHP'].map(skill => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5"/><path d="M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12"/></svg>
          Bases de Datos
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Oracle', 'SQL Server', 'PostgreSQL', 'MySQL', 'MariaDB'].map(skill => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"/></svg>
          Infraestructura & Cloud
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['AWS', 'Google Cloud', 'Debian/Ubuntu', 'Nginx', 'DNS/SMTP/FTP', 'Azure DevOps'].map(skill => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
          Ecosistemas & Herramientas
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['PowerApps', 'Socket.IO', 'APIs/Web Services', 'Facturación Electrónica', 'Git' ].map(skill => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 text-sm font-medium">
              {skill}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
 

  </div>
</section>

 <section id="proyectos" class="py-20 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Proyectos Destacados</h2>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      {proyectos.map((proyecto) => (
        <div class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all flex flex-col">
          <div class="p-8 flex-1">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{proyecto.titulo}</h3>
              <span class={`px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold rounded-full uppercase ${proyecto.badgeColor}`}>
                {proyecto.badge}
              </span>
            </div>
            
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 italic">
              {proyecto.descripcion}
            </p>
            
            <ul class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 space-y-2 mb-6">
              {proyecto.puntos.map((punto) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-blue-500 mt-1">▹</span>
                  <span>{punto}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
              {proyecto.tech.map((t) => (
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 rounded text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-600">
                  {t}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          {proyecto.link && (
            <div class="px-8 pb-8">
              <a 
                href={proyecto.link} 
                target="_blank" 
                class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-semibold flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline group-hover:gap-2 transition-all"
              >
                {proyecto.linkText} 
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
                </svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
 

<section id="contacto" class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
  
<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6">
